Project: Dictionary Application
API: Free Dictionary API - https://freedictionaryapi.com/
     Endpoint: https://freedictionaryapi.com/api/v1/entries/en/<word>

How to run: Open index.html in a browser and click the link to the app or just go to https://kienodjoy1.github.io/LEKION/.
No API key or installation needed. An internet connection is required.
